\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\qc\ul\b\f0\fs28\lang9 PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD)\par
Project Title: LuxeMart Android E-Commerce Application\ulnone\b0\fs22\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f1\fs24 1. Project Overview\fs22\par

\pard\li360\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0\f0 LuxeMart is a mobile Android e-commerce application designed to allow users to browse products, add items to a cart, and complete purchases directly from their smartphones.\par
The application aims to provide a simple, fast, and user-friendly shopping experience for customers while allowing businesses to present their products digitally.\par
\b\i The system is built using:\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li1080\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0\i0 Java (Android Studio)\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}XML (User Interface Layouts)\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f1\fs24 2. Problem Statement\b0\f0\fs22\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1 Many small businesses lack accessible digital platforms where customers can easily browse and purchase products online.\par
Traditional shopping methods:\par
require physical visits\par
consume time\par
limit product visibility\par
LuxeMart solves this problem by providing a mobile platform for browsing and purchasing products conveniently.\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\f1\fs24 3. Project Objectives\b0\f0\fs22\par
\b Main Objective\b0\par
To develop a fully functional Android-based e-commerce application that allows users to browse products, add them to a cart, and complete checkout.\par
\b\i Specific Objectives\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0\i0 To design an intuitive mobile shopping interface.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}To allow users to register and log in securely.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}To enable browsing of available products.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}To allow users to add and remove items from the cart.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}To implement a checkout and payment interface.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}To provide a smooth and responsive user experience.\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\f1\fs24 4. Target Users\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0\f0\fs22 Primary Users\par
Mobile shoppers\par
Customers looking to purchase products online\par
Secondary Users\par
Businesses wanting to display and sell their products digitally.\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\f1\fs24 5. Key Features\f0\fs22\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\i\fs24 5.1 User Registration\b0\i0\par
\fs22 Users can create an account using the SignupActivity.\par
Functions:\par
Enter name\par
Enter email\par
Enter password\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\i\fs24 5.2 User Login\b0\i0\fs22\par
Registered users can log in using LoginActivity.\par
Functions:\par
Email authentication\par
Password verification\par
Access personal shopping session\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\i\fs24 5.3 Product Browsing\fs22\par
\b0\i0 Users can browse available products displayed in the main screen.\par
Features:\par
Product image\par
Product name\par
Product price\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\i\fs24 5.4 Product Details\fs22\par
\b0\i0 When a product is selected, the application displays detailed information.\par
Includes:\par
Product image\par
Description\par
Price\par
Add to cart button\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\i\fs24 5.5 Shopping Cart\b0\i0\fs22\par
Users can add products to the cart.\par
Features:\par
View selected items\par
Adjust quantity\par
Remove products\par
View total price\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\i\fs24 5.6 Checkout System\b0\i0\fs22\par
The checkout activity allows users to finalize their purchase.\par
Includes:\par
Order summary\par
Customer details\par
Payment option selection\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\i\fs24 5.7 Payment Interface\par
\b0\i0\fs22 The payment activity processes the order payment.\par
Possible payment options:\par
\tab Mobile payment\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\f1\fs24 6. Functional Requirements\b0\f0\fs22\par
\b\i\fs24 Requirement ID\fs22\par
Description:\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\i0\fs24 FR1\par
\b0\fs22 The system must allow users to register an account\par
\b\fs24 FR2\par
\b0\fs22 The system must allow users to log in\par
\b\fs24 FR3\b0\fs22\par
The system must display available products\par
\b\fs24 FR4\b0\fs22\par
Users must be able to add products to the cart\par
\b\fs24 FR5\b0\fs22\par
Users must be able to remove items from the cart\par
\b\fs24 FR6\b0\fs22\par
The system must calculate the total price\par
\b\fs24 FR7\b0\fs22\par
Users must be able to proceed to checkout\par
\b\fs24 FR8\b0\fs22\par
The system must provide a payment interface\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\f1\fs24 7. Non-Functional Requirements\b0\f0\fs22\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1 Performance\par
The application should load products quickly.\par
Usability\par
The interface should be simple and user-friendly.\par
Reliability\par
The system should operate without frequent crashes.\par
Compatibility\par
The application should run on most Android devices.\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
